    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Shards</strong> is an action roguelite with readable, timing-based combat and flexible builds. Learn enemy patterns, tune your loadout, and push through procedural rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy encounter rewards careful timing, thoughtful positioning, and skill-based resource management. Master unique weapon combos, exploit clearly telegraphed enemy attacks, and utilize a variety of items to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle through spells, artifacts, and elemental infusions. Discover powerful synergies, unlock game-changing modifiers, and experiment with countless build combinations. Whether you prefer aggressive melee, precise ranged combat, or versatile spellcasting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elements and Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of six distinct elements: Fire, Ice, Lightning, Dark, Wind, and Physical, each with unique mechanics. Integrate spells seamlessly into combat, complementing weapon attacks to shape battles according to your strategic vision. From offense-focused spellcasting to defensive and supportive loadouts, the game's rich elemental system offers thoughtful depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate procedurally generated dungeons filled with meaningful choices and thoughtful opportunities. Decide carefully between loot, elemental upgrades, and more. Each choice significantly impacts your run, ensuring no two playthroughs feel the same, and offering endless opportunities for discovery and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an endlessly engaging journey in <strong>Shape Shards</strong>, where every run presents fresh skill-based challenges, rewarding depth, and exciting combat encounters tailored by your unique choices and strategies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Shards</strong> is an action roguelite with readable, timing-based combat and flexible builds. Learn enemy patterns, tune your loadout, and push through procedural rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy encounter rewards careful timing, thoughtful positioning, and skill-based resource management. Master unique weapon combos, exploit clearly telegraphed enemy attacks, and utilize a variety of items to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/38e673e1e65737ee3786743f347ed8b2.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle through spells, artifacts, and elemental infusions. Discover powerful synergies, unlock game-changing modifiers, and experiment with countless build combinations. Whether you prefer aggressive melee, precise ranged combat, or versatile spellcasting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/eb02a71803bedcc00dfbbdf28a3ccfc3.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elements and Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of six distinct elements: Fire, Ice, Lightning, Dark, Wind, and Physical, each with unique mechanics. Integrate spells seamlessly into combat, complementing weapon attacks to shape battles according to your strategic vision. From offense-focused spellcasting to defensive and supportive loadouts, the game's rich elemental system offers thoughtful depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/4aadb4dddb448957dabe26341188401e.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate procedurally generated dungeons filled with meaningful choices and thoughtful opportunities. Decide carefully between loot, elemental upgrades, and more. Each choice significantly impacts your run, ensuring no two playthroughs feel the same, and offering endless opportunities for discovery and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.poster.avif?t=1754972551\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.webm?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797860/extras/713aa942394f895e01a822c77330fae1.mp4?t=1754972551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an endlessly engaging journey in <strong>Shape Shards</strong>, where every run presents fresh skill-based challenges, rewarding depth, and exciting combat encounters tailored by your unique choices and strategies.</p>",
